<description>&lt;p&gt;An illegal gold mine in southwest Colombia collapsed, killing 14 miners and injuring 7. The Colombian government is preparing a decree to define maritime boundaries for the San Andres, Providencia and Santa Catalina Archipelago while former rebel leaders face war crimes charges related to Indigenous groups. De la Espriella launched a total offensive against the ELN and dissident FARC forces in Arauca. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQdXlYMzh3QUw0aF9zelFsdV9qVnhWOGV3MWR2UWZDazBxOUdyU2xuZ3JnUEItWEJ3cGYzNGVpVzBMYVAxN2lFdkk3d3lUaHp5Zkt2Yl9YOWdldnpKUnE2YTd4T05FclBQbFRJMEtoY1lpSlNxWDlFLXJjWkhQVjhSUG8xWS1tczVoYnhadGZUd0pqU0JxTjVTVlFsWGFqbjdOZ0NnZkxITVVQaW8tQUNXaEw3OElqal9BTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPa3U4RmVOMk1VSzItczZ4eldvWFl1bE8yeExOMW5wdXAtUWkxUzdUQXRvMlAtd1lQaXZuQ241b3loenV5ZTFqT0NLTlc2dFc2eTA1VGkzeFZ1Y3l0bG5pUEdCeldQWjIwQzhScFZKaWpycmt5UEJ4NE54SmJpd2RjQVMzeEtGSUZQZ1JudnNvQlNPT2NwUG9Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;İlke Haber Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOSUFlMF9Ca0N0dVdyaGtlOGl5eDRUaUhpRkZNSW9vVjVWcWtGblJDb2JYWlVjUTltaWY0dWUtM3owYUR0eGRSRko1eHBhUXloS1JSTlVjSGMxVUlqWFZCM3RZN0swVTc0eDNoTTNRQTkzVG1MTkxwNEV2cTBkenhIdFFqRlRvaTlybkNBXzI4eExmOGQzckFKODJ4aThrM3dtN1dMZnJpSkhEeGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQOTlqOFpSLURMNVNKSy1TV0xXQ1o4a1hGcUt0OEF6enJzY0ppMHp0TnA1QjRsV1pnNWFYdmRvRWgtSEJRVFZlN3lLTFJudDV1eVlaaEZGWUpSdXFxMXJUYlVHRTdpUXJaaXl0SnVHb3VrdGhDblNVQ2ExNXd4ZkVwRnJIcGVYZFdpTnB0dlczWEFHdHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Menafn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href